{
  "_comment": [
    "Waystone POI tags per map, for the Disabled Waystones picker in Game Settings.",
    "",
    "`key` is what Game.ini's ServerMap holds: the map name for Alderon's own maps,",
    "and the mod SKU (as listed in map-mods.txt) for modded maps. The panel resolves",
    "a modded server's ServerMap mount back to its SKU before looking a map up here.",
    "",
    "An EMPTY waystones array means the map genuinely has no waystones - that is a",
    "real answer, not missing data, and the picker says so rather than falling back",
    "to offering every other map's tags. A map absent from this list entirely is",
    "unknown, and the picker then offers the full grouped list instead.",
    "",
    "Source: https://nexlinkcore.com/guides/path-of-titans/maps-info - captured",
    "2026-09-20. The game's own /ListWaystones console command is the authoritative",
    "source and should replace this file once a server with waystones enabled can be",
    "read reliably; see the Path of Titans REST API note in the handbook.",
    "",
    "Tags are case-sensitive and must match the waystone's POI name exactly."
  ],
